# Velocity plugin contract (skin)

## Base

- Addon id: `plugin.video.velocity2` (use `plugin://plugin.video.velocity2/?action=...`).

## High-traffic paths

- Home: `action=home`
- Catalog list (paged): `action=list&list_id=<id>&page=<n>` — may add **Next Page >>** folder item when the addon returns `next_page`.
- Smart rails: `action=smart_list&type=<type>` where `type` includes: `up_next`, `active_shows`, `new_episodes`, `in_progress_movies`, `recent` / `recently_watched`, `continue_watching`
- TV: `action=view_show&id=<tv-*>` → `action=view_season&show_id=<id>&season=<n>`
- Play: `action=play&id=<internal_id>` or `action=select` (same resolve path)
- Discovery: `action=discover` or `action=discovery&preset_id=...`

## Pitfall

- **Spotlight vs widgets:** reusing the same `list` path as a full browse may show **Next Page** in the hero; use a dedicated contract (e.g. future `paginate=false`) or cap items in the skin — see addon roadmap `plans/af3-skin-fork-roadmap.md` Phase 2.

